  "notes": [
    "The position contract only became collateral when ImpermaxV3Collateral._initialize pointed the WETH/USDC lending pool at it, about three minutes after its deployment. That listing is the latest change the exploit needed; later safety-margin and fee changes only scale the loss.",
    "Campaign: the transactions, from either attacker EOA, that depleted the six Base borrowables and the five on Arbitrum (sibling pools of the same factory code). The roughly 4,800 other attacker transactions moved nothing, and later third-party restructureBadDebt calls touched only dust.",
